></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-9307660-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9307660</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1117062A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJITSU LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO SHIGERU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NIWATA TSUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITSU LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO, SHIGERU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NIWATA, TSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO SHIGERU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NIWATA TSUYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO, SHIGERU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NIWATA, TSUYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An IC card processing apparatus comprises an MPU (51) for controlling access to an IC (22) holding a card security code and card information, and a keyboard section (58A) for use to input a machine security code for collation with a card security code. When referring to card information, the MPU (51) retrieves the machine security code from a nonvolatile memory (59) and provides it for the IC card (22). The IC card (22) compares the input machine security code with the card security code stored in it. If the two security codes coincide with each other, the MPU (51) is allowed to have access to the IC card to read information and carry out some processing.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un appareil de traitement d'une carte à circuit intégré comprenant un microprocesseur (MPU) (51) permettant de commander l'accès à un circuit intégré (22) contenant un code de sécurité de carte et des informations de carte, et un clavier (58A) utilisé pour introduire un code de sécurité de machine en vue du collationnement avec un code de sécurité de carte. Lorsqu'il s'agit d'informations de carte, le microprocesseur (51) extrait d'une mémoire non volatile (59) le code de sécurité de machine et le fournit à la carte (22) à circuit intégré. La carte (22) à circuit intégré compare le code de sécurité de machine introduit au code de sécurité de carte qu'elle conserve dans sa mémoire. Si les deux codes de sécurité correspondent l'un avec l'autre, le microprocesseur (51) est autorisé à accéder à la carte à circuit intégré pour y lire les informations et procéder à quelque traitement.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set f